WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.025
The practice database contains four small tables and
one convenience view patient_info

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:12.575
includes demographics contacts activity status
consent and preferred language diagnostics

00:00:12.588 --> 00:00:18.225
adds diagnosis severity and confirmation state
patient_billing includes

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:23.838
bill amounts payments and payment status admissions
contains admission and discharge

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:28.938
dates The patient_case view combines the first three
tables so this module

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:33.812
can focus on logic rather than join syntax The data
intentionally includes

00:00:33.838 --> 00:00:38.575
NULL values empty strings whitespace-only strings a
zero bill a missing payment

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:43.350
status and an unknown consent value Those edge cases
make the logic

00:00:43.375 --> 00:00:48.862
visible Everything is synthetic and disposable so
students can experiment safely
